<title>USA: Motors and Gears Inc issues $170 mln 144a debt.</title>
<headline>Motors and Gears Inc issues $170 mln 144a debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement debt issue from Motors and Gears Inc was priced on Friday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER MOTORS AND GEARS INC</p>
<p>AMT $170 MLN	 COUPON 10.750     MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE NA</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.750	PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B			  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT 109.75.</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
